  <section class="section"><div class="container prose-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR PURPOSE</p><h2>Shipping made simpler.</h2></div><div><p>Deliverio Express is a Karachi-focused courier service built to make shipping simpler for online sellers. We provide Cash on Delivery delivery within Karachi, free pickup for sellers sending three or more parcels, and COD payouts within 24 hours of delivery. For destinations outside Karachi, we connect sellers with partner couriers. Our goal is to give growing businesses clear rates, dependable communication, and a straightforward way to get orders moving.</p></div></div></section>
